      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The U‑Drop Inn, a Route 66 icon, was restored with a $1.7 million grant and now houses a museum, gift shop, and the city’s chamber of commerce.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
